## Second-pass after expand vs refuse until later (Decide card)

| | Refuse macros until later (I1+I2) | Second-pass after expand (I8) |
|--|-----------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| 2.8 pin | SPRINT allows **residual doc** | Asks for a pass **if** bodies expand |
| Host proof | check residual **live** both names | **No expand** to walk |
| Secret FN today? | **No** — string body stays a string | N/A until expand exists |
| emit-llvm `@macro_expand` | Named residual (I5); still no rewrite | Would become a **real** FN if expand is silent |
| Entropy \(S\) | **Down** (untested FIXED → proved refuse) | **Up** (new language feature) |
| Ship this turn | **Yes** | **No** (moonshot) |
| When expand ships | Keep refuse until the walk exists | **Mandatory same patch** |

**Ship-now decision:** **refuse until later.** Rank post-expand walk as the **reopen gate**, not this close.

A stub pass on unexpanded toks (I7) is **neither** side of this card — prune it.

